/* tool 125: Ergo shared expense settlement builder — a group's
   shared costs split equally, balances netted, debts simplified
   greedily (largest debtor with largest creditor, ties by list
   order). Fee 1% of the total settled debt only, charged only
   when a debt actually moves. All cases verified with an
   independent Python oracle before the JS existed
   (oracle-groupexp.py, exact integer arithmetic). */
